{"entryId":"1707","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1707:1","sourceSha256":"8b79d2bf6dff94a89fad890c20d30832e71aee9c9cc64b63c0343fa1a3b1327e","englishSha256":"c9d90c1f0084dd9719c3cbec67986b80507286a01679e56a31550c9cdccdcdb7","citations":[{"id":"1707:1:citation-01","he":[18,127],"en":[248,258],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_61b.8"},"reference":"Eruvin 61b:8","assessment":"Eruvin has Mar Yehudah instruct them to put the eruv farther in. Rashi locates it toward the far end of the synagogue and explains that Rava calls him a dissenter from the Sages.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 61b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_61b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Eruvin 61b:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_61b.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Eruvin 61b:8:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Eruvin_61b.8.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rashi on Eruvin 61b:9:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Eruvin_61b.9.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"1707:1:citation-02","he":[129,179],"en":[358,374],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Avodah_Zarah_16b.8"},"reference":"Avodah Zarah 16b:8","assessment":"Mar Yehudah reports to Abaye that the household of Mar Yochani ground with wild asses. The house modifies the report rather than his own title.","evidence":[{"reference":"Avodah Zarah 16b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Avodah_Zarah_16b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1707:1:citation-03","he":[181,208],"en":[393,404],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_48a.2"},"reference":"Chullin 48a:2","assessment":"Mar Yehudah transmits a lung ruling in Avimi’s name.","evidence":[{"reference":"Chullin 48a:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_48a.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1707:1:citation-04","he":[210,235],"en":[417,445],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_24a.6"},"reference":"Eruvin 24a:6","assessment":"Eruvin 24a identifies the visitor and host and records their exchange about Avimi’s ruling. Heilprin’s Rav Huna entry cites the same visit.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 24a:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_24a.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 995:1","target":{"entry":995,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id":"1707:1:citation-05","he":[237,288],"en":[521,534],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_58a.3"},"reference":"Kiddushin 58a:3","assessment":"Mar Yehudah meets Rav Yosef and Rav Shmuel at the door of Rabbah’s house. They later ask Rabbah. Keep Heilprin’s Rava separately as a variant and retain the distinction from the Eruvin visit.","evidence":[{"reference":"Kiddushin 58a:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_58a.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 58a:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_58a.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 58a:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_58a.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2,3,4],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"Distinguish the two visits, the synagogue instruction, the Avimi chain, and the actual scope of Mar Yehudah’s statement to Abaye.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 61b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_61b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Eruvin 61b:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_61b.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Eruvin 61b:8:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Eruvin_61b